; Planner.scaly - Generic resolution, type inference, and name mangling.
; Transforms Model (generics) into Plan (concrete types, mangled names).
;
; Ported afresh from scalyc/Planner.cpp (~13K LOC, ~97 methods).
; Covers the full planning pipeline — plan_program → plan_module →
; plan_namespace/plan_concept → plan_structure/plan_union/plan_global
; /plan_function/plan_operator/plan_initializer/plan_deinitializer —
; HM type inference (unify, solve_constraints, apply_substitution),
; Itanium ABI name mangling, overload resolution with generic
; inference, member-access + method-chain resolution, iterator
; protocol, and branch-result unification.
;
; The only paths that abort via not_implemented are the package
; loader's parse+model steps, which need Scaly-side access to the
; Parser and Modeler as callable modules.

